{"id":"426b1e91662e3168","group":"62","path":"62/62-df-order-comparison.md","title":"Initial Segment Comparison of Orders","display":"df-order-comparison — Initial Segment Comparison of Orders","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)","book_abbrev":"62","label":"62-df-order-comparison","aliases":["62-df-order-comparison"],"display":"df-order-comparison — Initial Segment Comparison of Orders","depends_on":["[[62-df-linear-order]]","[[62-df-coded-function]]"],"source":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), Definition V.2.7","source_pages":[176,177],"source_pdf_pages":[194,195]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"62"},{"key":"label","html":"62-df-order-comparison"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>62-df-order-comparison</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-order-comparison — Initial Segment Comparison of Orders"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ecc1f15e98d07497\" href=\"?note=ecc1f15e98d07497\" title=\"62-df-linear-order\">62-df-linear-order</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c156c03daff0aff0\" href=\"?note=c156c03daff0aff0\" title=\"62-df-coded-function\">62-df-coded-function</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), Definition V.2.7"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>176</span><span>177</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>194</span><span>195</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>线性序 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(W,R)\">\\((W,R)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(V,S)\">\\((V,S)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ecc1f15e98d07497\" href=\"?note=ecc1f15e98d07497\" title=\"62-df-linear-order\">62-df-linear-order</a>；数值函数图见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c156c03daff0aff0\" href=\"?note=c156c03daff0aff0\" title=\"62-df-coded-function\">62-df-coded-function</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_{&lt;a}=\\{v\\in V:v\\prec_S a\\}\">\\(V_{&lt;a}=\\{v\\in V:v\\prec_S a\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S|_{V_{&lt;a}}\">\\(S|_{V_{&lt;a}}\\)</span> 为同时限制两个坐标的诱导序。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_{\\mathrm{ord}}\">\\(\\le_{\\mathrm{ord}}\\)</span> 在 Assertion 中引入。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}order\\text{-}comparison}\\vdash\\;\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{Iso}(f;W,R;V,S)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\mathsf{LO}(W,R)\\land\\mathsf{LO}(V,S)\\land\\mathsf{Fun}(f,W,V)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall x,y\\in W(x\\prec_R y\\leftrightarrow f(x)\\prec_S f(y))\\land\\forall v\\in V\\exists w\\in W\\;f(w)=v,\\\\\n\\mathsf{InitEmb}(f;W,R;V,S)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\mathsf{Iso}(f;W,R;V,S)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\lor\\exists a\\in V\\;\\mathsf{Iso}(f;W,R;V_{&lt;a},S|_{V_{&lt;a}}),\\\\\n(W,R)\\le_{\\mathrm{ord}}(V,S)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\exists f\\;\\mathsf{InitEmb}(f;W,R;V,S).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}order\\text{-}comparison}\\vdash\\;\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{Iso}(f;W,R;V,S)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\mathsf{LO}(W,R)\\land\\mathsf{LO}(V,S)\\land\\mathsf{Fun}(f,W,V)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall x,y\\in W(x\\prec_R y\\leftrightarrow f(x)\\prec_S f(y))\\land\\forall v\\in V\\exists w\\in W\\;f(w)=v,\\\\\n\\mathsf{InitEmb}(f;W,R;V,S)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\mathsf{Iso}(f;W,R;V,S)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\lor\\exists a\\in V\\;\\mathsf{Iso}(f;W,R;V_{&lt;a},S|_{V_{&lt;a}}),\\\\\n(W,R)\\le_{\\mathrm{ord}}(V,S)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\exists f\\;\\mathsf{InitEmb}(f;W,R;V,S).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>不是任意保序嵌入，而是到整个目标或某个严格初始段的同构。这里直接指定切点，避免在 RCA₀ 中先假定任意函数的值域集合存在。限制集由有界理解存在；结构的载体与序都在签名中明确。空序和相等序都允许比较。</p>\n<p>来源：第二版（2009），Definition V.2.7；纸面页 176, 177；PDF 页 194, 195。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"62-df-linear-order","status":"resolved","id":"ecc1f15e98d07497","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-linear-order]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-coded-function","status":"resolved","id":"c156c03daff0aff0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-coded-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-linear-order","status":"resolved","id":"ecc1f15e98d07497","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"线性序 $(W,R)$、$(V,S)$ 见 [[62-df-linear-order]]；数值函数图见 [[62-df-coded-function]]。$V_{<a}=\\{v\\in V:v\\prec_S a\\}$，$S|_{V_{<a}}$ 为同时限制两个坐标的诱导序。","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-coded-function","status":"resolved","id":"c156c03daff0aff0","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"线性序 $(W,R)$、$(V,S)$ 见 [[62-df-linear-order]]；数值函数图见 [[62-df-coded-function]]。$V_{<a}=\\{v\\in V:v\\prec_S a\\}$，$S|_{V_{<a}}$ 为同时限制两个坐标的诱导序。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(W,R)","display":false},{"tex":"(V,S)","display":false},{"tex":"V_{<a}=\\{v\\in V:v\\prec_S a\\}","display":false},{"tex":"S|_{V_{<a}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\le_{\\mathrm{ord}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}order\\text{-}comparison}\\vdash\\;\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{Iso}(f;W,R;V,S)&\\leftrightarrow\\mathsf{LO}(W,R)\\land\\mathsf{LO}(V,S)\\land\\mathsf{Fun}(f,W,V)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\forall x,y\\in W(x\\prec_R y\\leftrightarrow f(x)\\prec_S f(y))\\land\\forall v\\in V\\exists w\\in W\\;f(w)=v,\\\\\n\\mathsf{InitEmb}(f;W,R;V,S)&\\leftrightarrow\\mathsf{Iso}(f;W,R;V,S)\\\\\n&\\quad\\lor\\exists a\\in V\\;\\mathsf{Iso}(f;W,R;V_{<a},S|_{V_{<a}}),\\\\\n(W,R)\\le_{\\mathrm{ord}}(V,S)&\\leftrightarrow\\exists f\\;\\mathsf{InitEmb}(f;W,R;V,S).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1723,"backlinks":[{"id":"c68a6ecbed6addff","anchor":"ref-42","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[62-df-order-comparison|Initial Segment Comparison of Orders]]"},{"id":"258c57f3152fa88d","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"理论见 [[62-df-RCA0]]、[[62-df-ATR0]]；WO 见 [[62-df-WellOrder]]，$\\le_{\\mathrm{ord}}$ 见 [[62-df-order-comparison]]，$\\Sigma^1_1\\text{-}\\mathrm{Sep}$ 见 [[62-df-Sigma11-separation]]；$\\operatorname{EquivOver}_{S_2}$ 见 [[62-df-equivalence-over-base]]。$\\mathrm{CWO}$ 在下式引入。"}],"outgoing":["ecc1f15e98d07497","c156c03daff0aff0"]}